| Name | Value | Token | Role |
|------|-------|-------|------|
| Background | `#F1F3F8` | `--color-bg` | Fondo general de la app |
| Surface 0 | `#FFFFFF` | `--color-surface-0` | Cards, modales, paneles |
| Surface 1 | `#F8F9FC` | `--color-surface-1` | Rows alternadas, inputs, sidebar hover |
