## Tokens — Typography

### Inter — UI principal · `--font-sans`
- **Substitute Google Font:** Inter (disponible directo)
- **Weights usados:** 400, 500, 600
- **NUNCA usar:** 700+ (lee genérico y pesado)

### JetBrains Mono — Datos numéricos y metadata · `--font-mono`
- **Substitute Google Font:** JetBrains Mono
- **Weights usados:** 400, 500
- **Uso:** fechas, timestamps, IDs, métricas puntuales

### Type Scale

| Role | Size | Weight | Line Height | Letter Spacing |
|------|------|--------|-------------|----------------|
| Display / KPI grande | 32px | 600 | 1.1 | -0.025em |
| Heading 1 | 24px | 600 | 1.2 | -0.02em |
| Heading 2 | 18px | 600 | 1.3 | -0.015em |
| Heading 3 | 16px | 500 | 1.4 | 0 |
| Body | 14px | 400 | 1.6 | 0 |
| Body small | 13px | 400 | 1.5 | 0 |
| Label / caption | 12px | 500 | 1.4 | 0.02em |
| Mono / metadata | 12px | 400 | 1.5 | 0 |

